<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_tpl_app_online">TplAppOnline</link></para>

<para>This class provides methods to handle the online/offline status of the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It includes functionalities for generating actions and menu items to switch the application between online and offline states. </para>
