    <title>getActionStatus()</title>
<indexterm><primary>getActionStatus</primary><secondary>TplAppOnline</secondary></indexterm>
<indexterm><primary>TplAppOnline</primary><secondary>getActionStatus</secondary></indexterm>
<para><computeroutput>getActionStatus ( $status)<computeroutput>[static]</computeroutput></computeroutput></para>
<para>Generates the action string to switch the online/offline status.</para>

<para>This method creates the action string for switching the application&apos;s online/offline status. It includes commands to restart relevant services and reload the application. The action string is used to define what happens when the status switch action is triggered.</para>

